{
  "version": "1.0",
  "updated": "2026-06-20",
  "principle": "AI-startup capabilities across modalities (document/image/text/video/audio/multimodal), reverse-engineered into input\u2192output pipelines. EVERY pipeline shares one shape: ingest \u2192 parse/segment \u2192 [MODEL CORE] \u2192 validate/ground/rerank \u2192 structured output. The model core (OCR, embeddings, ASR, diarization, abstractive generation) is irreducible; the WRAPPER stages (preprocess, segmentation, timestamp/coordinate alignment, schema validation, ANN search, output shaping) are DETERMINISTIC \u2014 the governable, tunable spine. Each capability is therefore a tunable cascade: run the deterministic spine cheaply, escalate to the cheapest-capable model core only for what it must. Fully deterministic only where there is NO model core (web-content-extraction, scene-segmentation). Discovery!=trust; example startups are inferred from public product info; serves_truth=false.",
